    "s01": { "translation": "Receive, O Lord, the prayers of the faithful along with the oblations of sacrificial gifts, that through these services of pious devotion we may pass over to heavenly glory. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God,", "alignments": [{ "words": ["w032", "w033"], "anchor": "w032", "gloss": "of the Holy Spirit" }] },
